.SH "نام (NAME)"
zypp-NameReqPrv \- Investigate packages and dependencies in solver test\-cases
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBzypp\-NameReqPrv\fP [\fB\-\-root\fP \fIDIR\fP] [[\fIOPTIONS\fP] \fINAME\fP.\|.\|.].\|.\|.
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Load all enabled repositories (without refresh) and search for occurrences of regular expression \fINAME\fP in package names or dependencies. In case \fIDIR\fP denotes a directory containing a solver test\-case, repositories and settings provided by the test\-case are loaded instead.
.sp
A solver test\-case is an abstract of repositories, packages, hardware and dependency resolution related settings which can be created by using zyppers \fB\-\-debug\-solver\fP option. Attached to a bug report the test\-case helps investigating the reported behavior. Options and output of this command are tailored to this use\-case and may change as needed.
.sp
Reported matches show the packages \fIinternal id\fP, \fIname\fP, \fIversion\fP and \fIarchitecture\fP, \fIpriority\fP and name of the providing \fIrepository\fP, \fIvendor\fP, \fIbuildtime\fP and the locations matching \fINAME\fP.
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
2431\&  zypper\-1.9.16\-22.2.x86_64\&  (99)@System\&  openSUSE\&  1400499579
                                              nam: zypper
40947\&  zypper\-1.9.3\-1.1.x86_64\&    (99)repo\-oss (13.1)\&  openSUSE\&     1383049437
                                                       nam: zypper
56140\&  zypper\-1.9.16\-22.2.x86_64\&  (99)repo\-oss\-update (13.1)\&  openSUSE\&     1400499579
                                                              nam: zypper
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-\-root\fP \fIDIR\fP
.RS 4
Load repos from the system located below \fIDIR\fP. If \fIDIR\fP denotes a solver test\-case, the test\-case is loaded.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-installed\fP
.RS 4
Process installed packages only.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-i\fP/\fB\-I\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off case insensitive search (default on)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-n\fP/\fB\-N\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off looking for names       (default on)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-p\fP/\fB\-P\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off looking for provides    (default off)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-r\fP/\fB\-R\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off looking for requires    (default off)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-c\fP/\fB\-C\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off looking for conflicts   (default off)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o\fP/\fB\-O\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off looking for obsoletes   (default off)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-m\fP/\fB\-M\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off looking for recommends  (default off)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-s\fP/\fB\-S\fP
.RS 4
Turn on/off looking for supplements (default off)
.RE
.sp
\fB\-a\fP
.RS 4
Short for \fB\-n \-p \-r\fP
.RE
.sp
\fB\-A\fP
.RS 4
Short for \fB\-n \-P \-R\fP
.RE
.sp
\fB\-D\fP \fIPKG\fP
.RS 4
Dump dependencies of package \fIPKG\fP (exact name).
.RE
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.sp
Michael Andres \c
